:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows January to February under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. In 2025 the middle had April to May at 158% of normal and August to September at 39%. Grid 21159 had its driest year in 1953, at 54% of normal.</p>"}
